Malachite includes or is based on the following.

sdk/, nvrm/, hw/    Headers from NVIDIA's open GPU kernel modules, MIT.
                    https://github.com/NVIDIA/open-gpu-kernel-modules
core/, compiler/    Parts follow nouveau (Linux, MIT) and Mesa's NVK, NIL and NAK (MIT).
                    https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa

NVIDIA's GSP firmware is not in this repository. It is NVIDIA's, under its own licence, and the release packages carry
that licence with it.
